sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CLI as 命令行入口
  participant Runner as Gate 运行器
  participant Packages as Go 包分析器
  participant Validators as 签名与 CodeGraph 校验器

  CLI->>Runner: 启动影响检查
  Runner->>Runner: 读取基线与变更文件
  Runner->>Packages: 分析 Go 包影响
  Packages->>Packages: 构建反向依赖图
  Packages-->>Runner: 返回 dependents 与 blast radius
  Runner->>Validators: 检查导出声明变化
  Validators->>Validators: 比对删除与新增声明
  Validators-->>Runner: 返回 breaking exports
  Runner->>Validators: 校验 CodeGraph bundle
  Validators->>Validators: 校验 Mermaid 与源码位置
  Validators->>Validators: 校验生成的 HTML
  Validators-->>Runner: 返回 bundle 状态
  Runner->>Runner: 写入报告与 check 结果
